Package: com.guacforlife.filzabookmarkfix
Name: FilzaBookmarkFix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Repairs Filza bookmarks and recents that break when roothide's jbroot UUID changes. Rewrites stale absolute paths to their jbroot-relative form so they never go stale again.
